{"mode":"words","text":"Nüüd kuulad teksti ja loed seda samal ajal kaasa. Algajana loed tähenduse rida oma emakeeles, kuulad sihtkeelt aeglaselt ja vajutad sageli pausinuppu – nii seostab su aju heli tähendusega. Kui oled edasijõudnud õppija, loe originaalteksti ja vaata allapoole vaid tundmatute sõnade puhul. Kasuta selle juures sageli A-B-kordust: märgi üks lause ja lase seda korduvalt mängida – proovi seda ülal ära.","words":[{"s":0,"e":240},{"s":293,"e":640},{"s":707,"e":1120},{"s":1253,"e":1520},{"s":1573,"e":1840},{"s":1880,"e":2080},{"s":2120,"e":2320},{"s":2373,"e":2560},{"s":2613,"e":3200},{"s":3540,"e":4880},{"s":4933,"e":5120},{"s":5160,"e":5680},{"s":5720,"e":5920},{"s":5960,"e":6080},{"s":6133,"e":6960},{"s":7120,"e":7680},{"s":7733,"e":8400},{"s":8440,"e":9040},{"s":9200,"e":9520},{"s":9560,"e":9920},{"s":9980,"e":10320},{"s":10373,"e":11200},{"s":11480,"e":11760},{"s":11840,"e":12000},{"s":12080,"e":12560},{"s":12613,"e":12720},{"s":12760,"e":12960},{"s":13060,"e":13440},{"s":13520,"e":14400},{"s":14880,"e":15440},{"s":15480,"e":15760},{"s":15787,"e":16400},{"s":16640,"e":17280},{"s":17413,"e":17760},{"s":17824,"e":18960},{"s":19040,"e":19200},{"s":19253,"e":19600},{"s":19640,"e":20240},{"s":20280,"e":20480},{"s":20520,"e":21120},{"s":21160,"e":21520},{"s":21560,"e":22000},{"s":22280,"e":23360},{"s":23400,"e":23600},{"s":23627,"e":23840},{"s":23900,"e":24320},{"s":24520,"e":25760},{"s":26200,"e":26960},{"s":27000,"e":27120},{"s":27173,"e":27600},{"s":27760,"e":28080},{"s":28120,"e":28320},{"s":28380,"e":28640},{"s":28680,"e":29200},{"s":29240,"e":29680},{"s":30000,"e":30320},{"s":30380,"e":30720},{"s":30760,"e":30960},{"s":30987,"e":31200},{"s":31240,"e":31520}]}